factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The article says the summons is for 16th (வரும், 16ம் தேதி) without naming a month; the draft adds 'நவம்பர்' (November) and '16 நவம்பர்', which is not stated in the article.
  The article says Karthikeyan was summoned to appear before the headquarters police ADSP (ஏ.டி.எஸ்.பி.); the reel_script calls this officer 'கூடுதல் காவல் கண்காணிப்பாளர்' (additional superintendent of police), which is an incorrect rank/role translation.
  The article says the 16th summons is at 'திருச்சி எஸ்.பி., அலுவலகம்' (Trichy SP office); the reel_script calls it 'காவல் கண்காணிப்பாளர் அலுவலகம்', which is consistent, but the slides_spec and caption mention 'திங்கட்கிழமை' (Monday) in the caption, a day-of-week claim not in the article.
  The reel_script says Karthikeyan was taken by the inspector to the Deputy Speaker's house after being 'threatened' (மிரட்டி) and the caption says he was taken 'மிரட்டி' — acceptable — but the reel_script states the inspector took him 'என கூறப்படுகிறது' while the caption states it as an 'குற்றச்சாட்டு' without this attribution being clearly tied to the article's wording; minor, but the reel_script also states Karthikeyan said 'மிரட்டித்தான் அவ்வாறு பேச வைக்கப்பட்டதாக' which mixes two claims (the threat and the inspector's role) in one sentence.
  The caption's line 'தாக்கியது உண்மை என்று கார்த்திக்குமார் கூறினார்' is fine, but the reel_script's 'துணை சபாநாயகரும் துறையூர் சட்டமன்ற உறுப்பினர்வுமான' contains an ungrammatical/garbled word ('உறுப்பினர்வுமான' should be 'உறுப்பினருமான').
  The article states the Deputy Speaker is also 'த.வெ.க.' (TVK) MLA; the reel_script and caption omit the party but do not contradict it—no issue. However the slides_spec line 'தாக்கியவர் துணை சபாநாயகர் ரவிசங்கர் என வீடியோ வெளியானது' states the video identified the attacker, while the article only says a video was released showing the attack; this is an invented detail.
  The reel_script omits the article's key point that the public and political leaders condemned the act and demanded the Deputy Speaker's removal from post; this important context is missing.
